WEBVTT

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:02.065
"The United States of America
v. One Solid Gold Object

00:03:02.089 --> 00:03:04.017
in the Form of a Rooster."

00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:07.307
(Laughter)

00:03:08.029 --> 00:03:09.180
Now, you're thinking:

00:03:09.204 --> 00:03:11.200
How does something like this happen?

00:03:11.665 --> 00:03:15.247
That's exactly what I said when
I first learned about civil forfeiture

00:03:15.271 --> 00:03:17.791
while on a road trip with my wife.

00:03:17.815 --> 00:03:19.559
No, we did not get pulled over.

00:03:19.583 --> 00:03:20.615
(Laughter)

00:03:20.639 --> 00:03:23.115
I was reading about
the history of civil forfeiture

00:03:23.139 --> 00:03:26.575
as part of my work as a research
director at the law firm,

00:03:26.599 --> 00:03:29.495
and I came across
one of the cases I just mentioned,

00:03:29.519 --> 00:03:33.464
"The United States of America
v. One 1990 Ford Thunderbird."